  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: integer overflow leading to heap buffer overflow in\n     xmlDictAddQString()\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-86138.patch: add SIZE_MAX-based overflow guards to\n       the pool size computation in xmlDictAddQString() in dict.c, plus a\n       SIZE_MAX fallback define, so an oversized prefix and name can no longer\n       wrap the allocation size and let the following memcpy() write past the\n       dictionary string pool\n     - CVE-2026-86138",
